{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And I will come down.</b> The Glory came down in fire within the cloud." "<b>And I will speak with you there.</b> And when you hear the voice, they too will hear." "<b>And I will take.</b> Like the sense of 'I will take from what is upon you.' And know that the spirit is like wisdom: if some of Reuben's wisdom is given to Simeon, Reuben's wisdom is not diminished but remains as it is. And the parable is the lamp."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:13.909849185Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}